            "privateNotes": "",
            "publicNotes": "<p>Munagolas are some of the most feared fiendish warriors in Hell, for they combine the aerial strength and craftiness of erinyes with sheer brute force rivaling that of the strongest devils. The first munagola was forged by Eiseth, Hell's Valkyrie, from the flesh of other devils. The process took centuries but resulted in a loyal soldier to rival her own rage and might. Since she established her realm in Dis, Eiseth has created armies of executioner devils to serve her will.</p>\n<p>Munagolas are vicious combatants, empowered by their fury and growing stronger with each successful blow, but their true strength lies in their commanding presence on the battlefield. They often lead troops of other flying devils from the front, driving them to faster and deadlier assaults that leave the enemies of their queen with no chance to respond.</p>\n<p>Munagolas and erinyes who serve Eiseth work well together, though a few munagolas hold contempt for the members of the Golden Company, believing their ostentatious armor to belittle the glory of battle. However, even such devils can't argue with the Golden Company's results.</p>",
            "publication": {
                "license": "ORC",
                "remaster": true,
                "title": "Pathfinder Lost Omens Cheliax, Infernal Inheritance"
            }
